raph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/8d0d2cdbf62d24a90ec547169f850144.webp?t=1787484862\" width=780 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep-Space Survival Horror:</strong> You are a pilot, not a fighter, and weapons are banned on the station. Avoid terrifying entities at all costs—even finding a modified working tool offers only a desperate, strictly limited lifeline against hostiles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/ec9e26cbebd249c45208de9c2d1d1311.poster.avif?t=1787484862\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/ec9e26cbebd249c45208de9c2d1d1311.webm?t=1787484862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/ec9e26cbebd249c45208de9c2d1d1311.mp4?t=1787484862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Inertia Physics:</strong> Feel the physical weight of deep space. True-to-life momentum physics means every movement requires deliberation—you cannot instantly accelerate, stop, or turn on a dime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Sci-Fi &amp; Cosmological Lore:</strong> Experience a story rooted in plausible astrophysics, quantum mechanics, and speculative science where real-world physics drive both narrative and gameplay tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% Diegetic &amp; Tactile Immersion:</strong> Total physical immersion. No floating hands, interaction icons, or artificial UI elements such as stamina or health bars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assess your physical state strictly through visual and audio cues such as heavy breathing and blurred vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate control panels, flip physical switches, and rely on real human-eye focal blur to identify interactive objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/95c772be095b16439eb9785c45e9fa43.poster.avif?t=1787484862\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/95c772be095b16439eb9785c45e9fa43.webm?t=1787484862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/95c772be095b16439eb9785c45e9fa43.mp4?t=1787484862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Environmental Navigation:</strong> No waypoint markers - finding your way is part of the experience. Slow down, observe your surroundings, and review data to uncover the path forward through careful exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Distinct Endings:</strong> Every choice, survival decision, and route you take directly alters the trajectory of your voyage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886980/extras/9b313fde481f516ddf6e71d117c22e57.webp?t=1787484862\" width=780 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A story-driven, first-person grounded sci-fi horror game inspired by astrophysics and speculative sc